                    d="M 12 21 C 12 21 3 13.5 3 8.5 C 3 5.5 5.5 3 8.5 3 C 10.5 3 11.5 4 12 5 C 12.5 4 13.5 3 15.5 3 C 18.5 3 21 5.5 21 8.5 C 21 13.5 12 21 12 21 Z"
